    "detailed_description": "Puzzle Me - All the fun of jigsaws, none of the frustration! Unless you want it :)<br><br>The ultimate jigsaw puzzle experience is here! Designed from the ground up for VR and taking advantage of the unique features and freedom of Virtual Reality - it is the most accessive and most intuitive way of solving jigsaw puzzles. Probably even beating the real thing!<br><br>With a range of unique difficulty options it can be the most zen and relaxing experience, the most mind bending challenge and everything in between.<br><br>With more puzzles and unique features on the way, this is the go-to game for ALL jigsaw puzzle fans - even those who don\u2019t know that they are ;)<br><br>Give it a try and join our Discord community where you can share your feedback and ideas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple &amp; intuitive Controls</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/c286a4546f02eed251e6017edefe2552.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/c286a4546f02eed251e6017edefe2552.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/c286a4546f02eed251e6017edefe2552.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solving outside of the canvas.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/d6e4ec8cb194b6458b5ba0d968af6194.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/d6e4ec8cb194b6458b5ba0d968af6194.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/d6e4ec8cb194b6458b5ba0d968af6194.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zen Mode</h2>Clutter free smooth experience! Small tray with only solvable pieces.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/5536280be356e67765c577b7afdb56d7.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/5536280be356e67765c577b7afdb56d7.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/5536280be356e67765c577b7afdb56d7.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple Mode</h2>Shows only solvable pieces.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/8bd66c129df78d381949a747ebd88e0d.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/8bd66c129df78d381949a747ebd88e0d.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/8bd66c129df78d381949a747ebd88e0d.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expert Mode</h2>Double sided pieces for extra challenge.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/abc361b12fa79e8a5f080d390636032c.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/abc361b12fa79e8a5f080d390636032c.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/abc361b12fa79e8a5f080d390636032c.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Puzzle Me - All the fun of jigsaws, none of the frustration! Unless you want it :)<br><br>The ultimate jigsaw puzzle experience is here! Designed from the ground up for VR and taking advantage of the unique features and freedom of Virtual Reality - it is the most accessive and most intuitive way of solving jigsaw puzzles. Probably even beating the real thing!<br><br>With a range of unique difficulty options it can be the most zen and relaxing experience, the most mind bending challenge and everything in between.<br><br>With more puzzles and unique features on the way, this is the go-to game for ALL jigsaw puzzle fans - even those who don\u2019t know that they are ;)<br><br>Give it a try and join our Discord community where you can share your feedback and ideas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple &amp; intuitive Controls</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/c286a4546f02eed251e6017edefe2552.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/c286a4546f02eed251e6017edefe2552.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/c286a4546f02eed251e6017edefe2552.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solving outside of the canvas.</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/d6e4ec8cb194b6458b5ba0d968af6194.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/d6e4ec8cb194b6458b5ba0d968af6194.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/d6e4ec8cb194b6458b5ba0d968af6194.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Zen Mode</h2>Clutter free smooth experience! Small tray with only solvable pieces.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/5536280be356e67765c577b7afdb56d7.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/5536280be356e67765c577b7afdb56d7.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/5536280be356e67765c577b7afdb56d7.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple Mode</h2>Shows only solvable pieces.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/8bd66c129df78d381949a747ebd88e0d.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/8bd66c129df78d381949a747ebd88e0d.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/8bd66c129df78d381949a747ebd88e0d.mp4?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expert Mode</h2>Double sided pieces for extra challenge.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/abc361b12fa79e8a5f080d390636032c.poster.avif?t=1657265141\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/942330/extras/abc361b12fa79e8a5f080d390636032c.webm?t=1657265141\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp